# A stream that opens on one row and closes on a later row (N19 multi-row). Remix parses
# every row when it arrives (Game.cs:567ff ParseGameRow per row; Other is parsed,
# Game.cs:1630-1635, 3063-3069 R). The Lich "main" strip carries the server string while
# the stream is unbalanced (lib/common/markup.rb strip_multiline) and delivers it only at
# popStream, so ours sees THOUGHTTOK and the plain main-stream PLAINTOK row late.
WAIT 100
IN <pushStream id='thoughts'/>[General] THOUGHTTOK one
WAIT 400
IN <popStream/>
WAIT 100
IN <pushStream id='percWindow'/>Spell one
WAIT 300
IN PLAINTOK arrives
WAIT 300
IN <popStream/>
WAIT 200
IN DONETOK
WAIT 300
